SquadReplay Agent Source-Available License 1.0

Copyright (c) 2026 BlueMoonTR / the SquadReplay project.

This repository contains the source code for the SquadReplay agent — the
component that runs on a Squad dedicated game server, reads live match
data from the game process's memory, and pushes it to a SquadReplay
central server (squadreplay.com or a self-hosted equivalent). It is
published so that anyone considering running the compiled agent binary
on their own server can read exactly what it does before trusting it —
including reading and writing files, network endpoints it contacts, and
the process-memory access it requires.

